// A physical exp pickup dropped by ExperienceUtility.TrySpawnDrop when a player-owned kill lands
// on an Enemy (see DamageUtility.ApplyDamage) - an environment/hazard kill (Owner == EntityRef.
// None) drops nothing. Value travels with the orb rather than being re-derived from
// EnemyDataAsset at pickup time, since the source enemy entity is already destroyed by then.
component ExpOrb
{
    FP Value;
}
